  "body": "You can see how prosody is authenticating against diaspora here\r\nhttps://github.com/Zauberstuhl/gem_diaspora-prosody-config/tree/master/modules\r\n\r\nThere is also ejabberd-diaspora auth and its in pythos so it may be easy to modify it\r\nhttps://github.com/bluszcz/ejabberd-diaspora-auth\r\n\r\nI'd like to run matrix service from diasp.in and poddery.com if we can get this working. It would also encourage many other diaspora pods (podupti.me has a list of pods) to activate it too making the matrix federation much bigger.",
